Package: spiR
Title: Statistical Performance Indicators Data Access
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("World Bank", "DECDG", email = "decdg@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Access and manage World Bank Statistical Performance Indicators (SPI) data.
    Provides functions to retrieve SPI final data, index data, raw data, and 
    output data from GitHub. Includes user-friendly inventory functions for 
    discovering datasets across different SPI versions.
